      "_id": "6ad3df7900191bab8a59019f",
      "title": "Portugal: The Country That Refused to Disappear",
      "content": "<p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">In 1385, Portugal faced a rather inconvenient situation. Castile had developed a sudden interest in Portuguese affairs, particularly the possibility of making Portugal considerably less Portuguese.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Naturally, the Portuguese were not particularly enthusiastic about this proposal.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">At the Battle of Aljubarrota, a smaller Portuguese army, supported by English allies and led by Nuno Álvares Pereira, defeated a much larger Castilian force. It was a remarkable victory, proving that numerical superiority means very little when your opponent has better tactics, stronger determination, and absolutely no intention of becoming Spanish.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The battle helped secure Portugal's independence and established the foundations of the Avis dynasty, which would later oversee one of the most extraordinary periods of maritime exploration in history.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">There is a valuable lesson here: <strong>a nation's strength is not measured solely by its numbers or wealth, but by its ability to remain united when it matters most.</strong><br><br>Of course, Spain has had its fair share of glorious victories throughout history. Convincing Portugal to join the family, however, has proven somewhat more challenging.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">After centuries of failed attempts, one might think our neighbours would have taken the hint.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">But perhaps we've misunderstood them all along.</p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Maybe they're not trying to conquer Portugal anymore. Maybe they just really, really want an invitation.</p>",
      "language": "en",
      "category": "news",
      "author": "6acb92afdf593b4329a7b560",
