      "_id": "6ad3c9d54e51639aefa7be6a",
      "title": "Official statement from the Vatican on Italy and Atlas",
      "content": "<p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Or as some call us <s>German</s> Italian proxy!</p><img class=\"tiptap-image\" src=\"https://media.warera.io/article-images/c6785fb7-d1ce-4548-852d-0aa2660b48d3-1792267906287.png\"><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: center;\">(It was all a masterplan, since i have always been famously pro Italian <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;emoteName&quot;:&quot;KEKW&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;:KEKW:&quot;}\" data-original-text=\":KEKW:\"></span> )<br><br><br>As everyone may have noticed, we decided to attack <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"region\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;regionId&quot;:&quot;6813b7039403bc4170a5d690&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/region/6813b7039403bc4170a5d690&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/region/6813b7039403bc4170a5d690\"></span>, which angered <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c\"></span> and directly led to our expulsion from <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"alliance\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;allianceId&quot;:&quot;6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c\"></span>.<br><br>Do I consider this a betrayal of the alliance? <br><br>Not really.<br><br> When we asked to join, we made it clear that our primary interest was in helping <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15cf&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15cf&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15cf\"></span> and <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15c1&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15c1&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/683ddd2c24b5a2e114af15c1\"></span> as they were our allies from the <span style=\"color: rgb(196, 197, 129);\">Holy League</span>.<br><br>Nevertheless, we participated in most of <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"alliance\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;allianceId&quot;:&quot;6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c\"></span> wars, doing what little damage we could to help our allies and sending money around.<br><br>The moment we did something they disliked however, they kicked us out. </p><img class=\"tiptap-image\" src=\"https://media.warera.io/article-images/35eeb888-020f-46e3-ab4e-abf9f077d0de-1792268775224.png\"><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br>Which honestly is fine, we were considering leaving before as the alliance had some drama internally and <span style=\"color: rgb(196, 197, 129);\">wasn't as interesting</span>. <br><br><br>Do i consider it a betrayal towards <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c\"></span>?<br><br><strong>No</strong>, we aren't allies even if we were in the past, our relations closed on a pretty nice note.<br><br>But contrary to what <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"alliance\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;allianceId&quot;:&quot;6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/alliance/6a2966e8f0f195d344d5158c\"></span> wanted us to do, we won't ask permission from <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c\"></span> to do something we consider fun, that's what proxies do <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;emoteName&quot;:&quot;Susge&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;:Susge:&quot;}\" data-original-text=\":Susge:\"></span> <br><br>And big nations aren't the only ones allowed to have fun.<br><br><br><strong>Also we're never dropping the RP</strong> <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;emoteName&quot;:&quot;AngryDys&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;:AngryDys:&quot;}\" data-original-text=\":AngryDys:\"></span> </p><img class=\"tiptap-image\" src=\"https://media.warera.io/article-images/c0380283-6cc0-4f79-a28e-dfa24027ad8a-1792269891742.png\"><img class=\"tiptap-image\" src=\"https://media.warera.io/article-images/e2e70354-6685-47d9-ab4e-ba0b13ddb8a9-1792269902425.png\"><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(196, 197, 129);\">What now:</span><br><br>I expect us to get wiped by  <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c\"></span><br><br>But i still like <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac79c\"></span> just like when they were young and bullied by the <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"country\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;countryId&quot;:&quot;6813b6d446e731854c7ac7e5&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac7e5&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/country/6813b6d446e731854c7ac7e5\"></span> <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"article\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;articleId&quot;:&quot;699dc3f00fc8c21bf3b378a0&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;https://app.warera.io/article/699dc3f00fc8c21bf3b378a0&quot;}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/article/699dc3f00fc8c21bf3b378a0\"></span> i'm not scared of them when they're strong <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{&quot;emoteName&quot;:&quot;peepoBox&quot;,&quot;fullMatch&quot;:&quot;:peepoBox:&quot;}\" data-original-text=\":peepoBox:\"></span> </p>",
